":24,"planned":54,"external":43},"Numerical computing and simulation",[],"Planned: coming. No connector is shipped yet; this page describes the intended integration.",{"title":72,"subtitle":73,"rows":74,"caption":73,"href":24},"Planned integration","",[],{"title":76,"subtitle":77,"rows":78,"caption":73,"href":24},"Role in Sim2Real","Runs scripted studies on the data of a model: parameter sweeps, signal processing of measurements and comparison of a simulated curve with a recorded one.",[],{"title":80,"subtitle":81,"rows":82,"caption":73,"href":24},"How the tool is reached","MATLAB offers an engine interface for Python and a batch mode; a fleet agent on a host with the licence would start a script with its inputs and return the figures and result files. No licence is bundled in the app and none is needed on the phone.",[],{"title":84,"subtitle":85,"rows":86,"caption":73,"href":24},"Inputs and outputs","In: parameters and measurement files (CSV, JSON). Out: result tables, plots as images and, for geometry studies, a mesh view as GLB.",[],{"title":88,"subtitle":89,"rows":90,"caption":73,"href":24},"Open-source alternative","GNU Octave runs most plain MATLAB scripts without a licence and would be the first target for scripts that do not need toolboxes.",[],{"title":92,"subtitle":93,"rows":94,"caption":73,"href":24},"Status","Planned. The HardTech-Stack-CAD-Simulators repository holds no connector for this tool yet; the page will switch to a live connection when one ships.",[]],"uses":{"params":["path"]}}]}
